    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the forgotten Sanctum of Eldoria, a mystical observatory suspended between the realms of mortals and the divine. The air is thick with ancient magic, and celestial dust settles on intricately carved stone pedestals. Centuries ago, the Archmages sealed a cataclysmic rift here, leaving behind a complex web of arcane mechanisms designed to test the worthiness of any who might seek to harness the Sanctum's true power. As the cosmic alignment nears, the seal begins to fracture, threatening to unleash chaos upon the world. Your objective is clear: you must reactivate the Sanctum's dormant magical network. By tracing the flow of ethereal energies and aligning the sacred artifacts, you can reignite the Final Ritual Altar and restore the seal before the astronomical convergence is complete. Beware, for magic is a precise art, and the order of the arcane forces is paramount. Your journey of deduction and discovery starts now.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
